From c20d5049273556069342eb38bb23ac61720debf7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ikloog <ikloog@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:19:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Side panel tabs keep their order and the one in front

Tabs dragged into another order are put in it again whenever the side
panels are tabbed together -- the window opening, Panels showing them,
the plugins' panels made again -- and the tab in front is brought back
then. Settings > General > Panel in front can name one to be in front
whenever the window opens instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
